# *.db
# *.sqlite3

# Large model weights — teacher/ensemble nets (offline pseudo-labeling) and base
# YOLO downloads: used by scripts/training only, never at runtime, and often
# >100MB (GitHub's hard limit). Keep them on disk, out of git.
/yolo*.pt
weights/

